# Everything in this repository is LF, in the index and in every working tree.
#
# Git for Windows defaults to core.autocrlf=true, which converts on checkout.
# That is not a cosmetic difference here: gofmt reports a CRLF file as
# unformatted, so a Windows checkout fails the format check on every .go file
# in the repository including ones nobody has touched, and install.sh and
# get.sh are not runnable with CRLF line endings at all.
#
# eol=lf settles it for good, and unlike a core.autocrlf setting in CI it also
# covers anyone who clones this on Windows to work on it.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary, so that "text=auto" never has to guess about them.
*.gif binary
*.png binary
